    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Nexus hums with morning chatter. 15 figures animating this realm. Felix Shadowmender, a quiet merchant, moves with purpose not far away. The world is quieted with gentle snow. The world is stark and hushed under winter.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-10T15:45:26.798230Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-10T15-45-26.798230Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The sun dips below over The Arena. I count 15 spirits, each present in their own way. Nearby, Sage Handsteady the teacher stands contemplating. dense fog swallows through the air. Winter has quieted the land.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-10T14:33:34.607725Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-10T14-33-34.607725Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>Afternoon shadows grow across The Athenaeum. 12 citizens are working around me. Luna Rootdeep, a thoughtful teacher, stands contemplating not far away. wild storm tears across the sky. Winter has frozen the land.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-10T13:38:56.124284Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-10T13-38-56.124284Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
